  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Water4Nampula</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of this project is to contribute to the achievement of the government of Mozambique of universal water coverage in all towns by 2030. The specific project objectives aim at increasing sustainable access to water services in the towns Namapa, Malema, Namialo, Nametil.This will be pursued by:&#x2022;Rehabilitating the existing water production and distribution.&#x2022;Extending the existing water production and distribution systems to increase service coverage of the systems to 80 litre per capita per day. With the support of D2B to relevant studies will be undertaken.</narrative>
  </description>
